# Chapter IV, Stormwend: the main story runs through the Thieves Guild. Golia
# sets a test -- steal a chicken cutlet from Salvadore the butcher -- and the
# guild takes the player in.
# Position stands in for the walks; ref FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from thief_golia
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Golia, by the city wall, wants proof before naming the guild.
case thief_golia
run
player->Position -5971 41036 232 0
until 600 "DIEBGolia".State == 2
wait 30
ask join the Thieves Guild
choose 1
choose 2
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 1
end

# Salvadore watches his stand too closely.
case thief_salvadore
run
player->Position -43 52119 214 0
talk SalvadoreDerMetzger
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 2
end

# Huxley the farmer can be talked into a quarrel with him.
case thief_huxley
run
player->Position -249 50766 260 0
talk DIEBHuxley
ask Salvadore
choose 2
choose 4
bye
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 4
end

# While they argue, the cutlet is there for the taking.
case thief_cutlet
until 600 player->GetPos Y > 52000
wait 60
take 0598DB15
until 300 player->GetItemCount SalvadoreHuhnerschnitzel01 == 1
end

# Golia is impressed, and names the secret entrance.
case thief_golia_cutlet
run
player->Position -5971 41036 232 0
talk DIEBGolia
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 5
end

# Through the secret entrance; the Masterthief explains the code.
case thief_masterthief
run
player->PositionCell -803 1914 323 0 "Stormwend, Thieves Guild"
talk DIEBMeisterdieb
ask join the Thieves Guild
choose 1
choose 2
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 8
end

# Jarko the juggler sends the player for a guild cape.
case thief_jarko
run
player->PositionCell -880 2456 323 0 "Stormwend, Thieves Guild"
talk DIEBJarkoderGaukler
ask about the Thieves Guild
choose 1
choose 3
choose 5
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 9
end

# Arille sells the cape for the code words.
case thief_arille
run
player->PositionCell -126 -331 127 0 "Stormwend, Arille's Trading House"
talk DIEBArille
ask special attire
choose 1
choose 6
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 11
end

# Black Eye Piet has a first job: a message for the Korynthian at the port.
case thief_piet
run
player->PositionCell -144 2481 325 0 "Stormwend, Thieves Guild"
talk DIEBSchwarzaugenPiet
ask What's the mark?
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde == 12
end
